[7626]={o="Bring 10 Elixirs of Shadow Power to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Elixir of Shadow Power (10)"},s="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",e="Gorzeeki Wildeyes"},
[7627]={o="Bring 6 Large Brilliant Shards and 25 Dark Iron Ore to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Large Brilliant Shard (6)","Dark Iron Ore (25)"},s="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",e="Gorzeeki Wildeyes"},
[7628]={o="Bring 35 Black Dragonscales to Gorzeeki Wildeyes in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Black Dragonscale (35)"},s="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",e="Gorzeeki Wildeyes"},
[7629]={o="Bring the Imp in a Jar to the alchemy lab in the Scholomance. After the parchment is created, return the jar to Gorzeeki Wildeyes.",r={"Parchment Created (1)","Imp in a Jar (1)"},s="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",e="Gorzeeki Wildeyes"},
[7630]={o="Bring 3 Arcanite Bar to Gorzeeki in the Burning Steppes.",r={"Arcanite Bar (3)"},s="Gorzeeki Wildeyes",e="Gorzeeki Wildeyes"},
[7631]={o="Read Mor'zul's Instructions. Summon a Xorothian Dreadsteed, defeat it, then bind its spirit to you.",r={"Xorothian Dreadsteed (1)"},s="Mor'zul Bloodbringer",e="Dreadsteed Spirit"},
[7632]={o="Find the owner of the Ancient Petrified Leaf. Good luck, adventurer; It's a big world.",r={"Ancient Petrified Leaf (1)"},e="Vartrus the Ancient"},
[7633]={s="Vartrus the Ancient",e="Vartrus the Ancient"},
[7634]={o="Hastat the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Blue Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Hastat in Felwood.",r={"Mature Blue Dragon Sinew (1)"},s="Hastat the Ancient",e="Hastat the Ancient"},
[7635]={o="Stoma the Ancient has asked that you bring him a Mature Black Dragon Sinew. Should you find this sinew, return it to Stoma in Felwood.",r={"Mature Black Dragon Sinew (1)"},s="Stoma the Ancient",e="Stoma the Ancient"},
[7636]={o="You must find and destroy these four demonic corrupters: Simone the Seductress. Klinfran the Crazed. Solenor the Slayer. Artorius the Doombringer. Destroy these creatures and return to Vartrus the Ancient in Felwood with their heads. Refer to the Petrified Bark in your inventory for clues as to their whereabouts. You MUST complete this task by yourself.",r={"Simone's Head (1)","Klinfran's Head (1)","Solenor's Head (1)","Artorius's Head (1)"},s="Vartrus the Ancient",e="Vartrus the Ancient"},
[7637]={o="Travel to Ironforge and get High Priest Rohan's Exorcism Censer. You will need to make a donation of 150 gold in order to secure it.",s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="High Priest Rohan"},
[7638]={o="Speak with Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District.",s="Duthorian Rall",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7639]={o="Return the Exorcism Censer to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",r={"Rohan's Exorcism Censer (1)"},s="High Priest Rohan",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7640]={o="Use the Exorcism Censer to drive out the spirits that torment Terrordale. When you have slain 25 Terrordale Spirits, return to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",r={"Terrordale Spirit (25)","Exorcism Censer (1)"},s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7641]={o="Speak with Grimand Elmore in Stormwind's Dwarven District.",s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="Grimand Elmore"},
[7642]={o="Bring 40 Runecloth, 6 Arcanite Bars, 10 Arthas' Tears, 5 Stratholme Holy Water vials, and 150 gold to Grimand Elmore in the Dwarven District of Stormwind.",r={"Stratholme Holy Water (5)","Arthas' Tears (10)","Runecloth (40)","Arcanite Bar (6)"},s="Grimand Elmore",e="Grimand Elmore"},
[7643]={o="Acquire special horse feed used for feeding a spirit horse. Merideth Carlson in Southshore apparently is the source for such food. Travel to the Dire Maul dungeon in Feralas and slay Tendris Warpwood. Doing so will free the Ancient Equine Spirit. Feed it the special horse feed, thereby soothing the spirit. Finally, give it the Arcanite Barding so it may bless it.",r={"Arcanite Barding (1)","Manna-Enriched Horse Feed (1)"},s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="Ancient Equine Spirit"},
[7644]={o="Return with the Blessed Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",r={"Blessed Arcanite Barding (1)"},s="Ancient Equine Spirit",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7645]={o="Retrieve 20 Enriched Manna Biscuits - the key ingredient in making Manna-Enriched Horse Feed - for Merideth Carlson at Southshore in the Hillsbrad Foothills. The Argent Dawn is known as the sole purveyor of the biscuits. You also need to give her 50 gold to soothe her ruffled sensibilities.",r={"Enriched Manna Biscuit (20)"},s="Merideth Carlson",e="Merideth Carlson"},
[7646]={o="Bring an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in the Cathedral District of Stormwind.",r={"Azerothian Diamond (1)","Pristine Black Diamond (1)"},s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7647]={o="Use the Divination Scryer in the heart of the Great Ossuary's basement in the Scholomance. Doing so will bring forth the spirits you must judge. Defeating these spirits will summon forth Death Knight Darkreaver. Defeat him and reclaim the lost soul of the fallen charger. Give the Charger's Redeemed Soul and the Blessed Enchanted Barding to Darkreaver's Fallen Charger.",r={"Charger's Redeemed Soul (1)","Blessed Arcanite Barding (1)"},s="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker",e="Darkreaver's Fallen Charger"},
[7648]={o="Take the Arcanite Barding to Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker in Stormwind's Cathedral District for his inspection.",r={"Arcanite Barding (1)"},s="Grimand Elmore",e="Lord Grayson Shadowbreaker"},
[7649]={o="Return the book to its rightful owners.",r={"Enchanted Thorium Platemail (1)"},e="Lorekeeper Lydros"},
[7650]={o="Return the book to its rightful owners.",r={"Enchanted Thorium Platemail (1)"},e="Lorekeeper Lydros"},
[7651]={o="Return the book to its rightful owners.",r={"Enchanted Thorium Platemail (1)"},e="Lorekeeper Lydros"},
