[7667]={o="If you are interested in helping Sagorne Crestrider in Orgrimmar's Valley of Wisdom, bring him an Azerothian Diamond and a Pristine Black Diamond.",r={"Azerothian Diamond (1)","Pristine Black Diamond (1)"},s="Sagorne Creststrider",e="Sagorne Creststrider"},
[7701]={o="Deep within the Slag Pit of the Cauldron, in the Searing Gorge, you will find the traitorous Dark Iron dwarf named Overseer Maltorius. Slay Overseer Maltorius and take his head. Return the head to Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker in the Searing Gorge for your reward.",r={"Head of Overseer Maltorius (1)"},e="Lookout Captain Lolo Longstriker"},
[7703]={o="Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",r={"Gauntlet of Gordok Might (1)"},s="Captain Kromcrush",e="Captain Kromcrush"},
[7704]={o="Take Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow to Evonice Sootsmoker in the Searing Gorge.",r={"Chambermaid Pillaclencher's Pillow (1)"},e="Evonice Sootsmoker"},
[7721]={o="Collect 10 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",r={"Water Elemental Core (10)"},s="Zorbin Fandazzle",e="Zorbin Fandazzle"},
[7722]={o="Somewhere in the Slag Pit of the Cauldron you will find the Secret Plans: Fiery Flux that Overseer Maltorius stole. Find those plans and return them to Master Smith Burninate in the Searing Gorge.",r={"Secret Plans: Fiery Flux (1)"},s="Master Smith Burninate",e="Master Smith Burninate"},
[7723]={o="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Heavy War Golems. The Heavy War Golems wander the areas surrounding the Cauldron in the Searing Gorge. When you've killed enough, return to Hansel in Searing Gorge.",r={"Heavy War Golem (20)"},s="Hansel Heavyhands",e="Hansel Heavyhands"},
[7724]={o="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Greater Lava Spiders in the Searing Gorge. You can find Greater Lava Spiders in the plateaus and lava pools of the Searing Gorge. Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Greater Lava Spiders.",r={"Greater Lava Spider (20)"},s="Hansel Heavyhands",e="Hansel Heavyhands"},
[7725]={o="Use Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker to zap any kind of giant found in Feralas into a more manageable form. Bring 10 Miniaturization Residues found on the zapped versions of these giants to Zorbin Fandazzle at the docks of the Forgotten Coast, Feralas.",r={"Miniaturization Residue (10)"},s="Zorbin Fandazzle",e="Zorbin Fandazzle"},
[7726]={o="Collect 6 Water Elemental Cores from the Sea Elementals and Sea Sprays along the Forgotten Coast of Feralas, and bring them back to Zorbin Fandazzle who is near the dock there.",r={"Water Elemental Core (6)"},s="Zorbin Fandazzle",e="Zorbin Fandazzle"},
[7727]={o="Hansel Heavyhands wants you to kill 20 Incendosaurs. You will find Incendosaurs occupying the lava pools inside the Slag Pit. The Slag Pit can be found in the Cauldron of the Searing Gorge. Return to Hansel Heavyhands in the Searing Gorge when you have killed enough Incendosaurs.",r={"Incendosaur (20)"},s="Hansel Heavyhands",e="Hansel Heavyhands"},
[7728]={o="Find and return the Smithing Tuyere and Lookout's Spyglass to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge. The only information you have about these items is the following: They were definitely stolen by Dark Iron dwarves. The Smithing Tuyere is a blacksmithing tool used by blacksmiths and the Lookout's Spyglass is an invaluable monitoring tool to lookouts.",r={"Smithing Tuyere (1)","Lookout's Spyglass (1)"},e="Taskmaster Scrange"},
[7729]={o="Slay 15 Dark Iron Taskmasters and 15 Dark Iron Slavers. Return to Taskmaster Scrange in the Searing Gorge once you have accomplished this task.",r={"Dark Iron Taskmaster (15)","Dark Iron Slaver (15)"},e="Taskmaster Scrange"},
[7730]={o="Bring 20 Zukk'ash Carapaces to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",r={"Zukk'ash Carapace (20)"},s="Hadoken Swiftstrider",e="Hadoken Swiftstrider"},
[7731]={o="Defeat Stinglasher in the Writhing Deep, bringing its glands back to Hadoken Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",r={"Stinglasher's Glands (1)"},s="Hadoken Swiftstrider",e="Hadoken Swiftstrider"},
[7732]={o="Deliver the Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report to Zilzibin Drumlore. He resides in the Drag of Orgrimmar.",r={"Camp Mojache Zukk'ash Report (1)"},s="Hadoken Swiftstrider",e="Zilzibin Drumlore"},
[7733]={o="Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Pratt McGrubben at Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",r={"Rage Scar Yeti Hide (10)"},s="Pratt McGrubben",e="Pratt McGrubben"},
[7734]={o="Bring 10 Rage Scar Yeti Hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",r={"Rage Scar Yeti Hide (10)"},s="Jangdor Swiftstrider",e="Jangdor Swiftstrider"},
[7735]={o="Bring the Pristine Yeti Hide to Pratt McGrubben at the Feathermoon Stronghold, Feralas.",r={"Pristine Yeti Hide (1)"},e="Pratt McGrubben"},
[7736]={o="Deliver 2 Incendosaur Scales, 4 Kingsblood and one Coal to Master Smith Burninate.",r={"Incendosaur Scale (2)","Kingsblood (4)","Coal (1)"},s="Master Smith Burninate",e="Master Smith Burninate"},
[7737]={r={"Dark Iron Residue (4)"},s="Master Smith Burninate",e="Master Smith Burninate"},
[7738]={o="Bring the Perfect Yeti Hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider at Camp Mojache, Feralas.",r={"Perfect Yeti Hide (1)"},e="Jangdor Swiftstrider"},
[7761]={o="That is one stupid orc. It would appear as if you need to find this brand and gain the Mark of Drakkisath in order to access the Orb of Command. The letter indicates that General Drakkisath guards the brand. Perhaps you should investigate."},
[7781]={o="Return the Head of Nefarian to Highlord Bolvar Fordragon in Stormwind.",r={"Head of Nefarian (1)"},e="Highlord Bolvar Fordragon"},
[7782]={o="Venture to the Valley of Heroes in Stormwind City and speak with Field Marshal Afrasiabi.",s="Highlord Bolvar Fordragon",e="Field Marshal Afrasiabi"},
[7783]={o="Return the Head of Nefarian to Thrall in Orgrimmar.",r={"Head of Nefarian (1)"},e="Thrall"},
