[7828]={o="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 10 Silvermane Stalkers and 10 Silvermane Howlers. Return to him once the task is complete. Markhor mentioned that the wolves hide in the wilds of the Hinterlands.",r={"Silvermane Stalker (10)","Silvermane Howler (10)"},s="Huntsman Markhor",e="Huntsman Markhor"},
[7829]={o="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill 20 Savage Owlbeasts. Return to him once the task is complete. Markhor mentioned that the Savage Owlbeasts occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",r={"Savage Owlbeast (20)"},s="Huntsman Markhor",e="Huntsman Markhor"},
[7830]={o="Huntsman Markhor at Revantusk Village in the Hinterlands wants you to kill a Razorbeak Skylord and retrieve its Skylord Plume. Return to him once the task is complete. Markhor mentioned that the Razorbeak Skylord are a rare breed that tend to occupy the wilds of the Hinterlands.",r={"Skylord Plume (1)"},s="Huntsman Markhor",e="Huntsman Markhor"},
